'use strict';
const REGIONS=[
['Glass Orchard','Canopy gardens','temperate',18,58,'A greenhouse-city where every pane is etched with a family tree. The glass blooms at night.','Pollen obscures old light signals.','Botanical samples are rich.'],['Cinder Quay','Tidal foundry','brackish',32,32,'An abandoned port of black copper. The tide keeps perfect time, though no clock agrees.','Salt storms corrode exposed lines.','Salvage yields rare alloys.'],['Listening Fold','Acoustic ravine','resonant',48,56,'A folded valley that answers footsteps with voices belonging to the missing.','Echoes disturb team focus.','Resonance reveals buried traces.'],['Morrow Steppe','Glass grassland','arid',63,35,'A silver prairie whose blades turn toward the last person to speak.','Water vanishes beneath the glass soil.','Long sightlines make routes safe.'],['Aster Vault','Buried archive','subterranean',78,55,'A library below the roots, catalogued by a machine that never forgets.','Power conduits are unstable.','Records accelerate research.'],['Sable Aerie','Cliff settlement','highland',88,28,'Houses hang from fossil-wing cliffs; doors open only when the wind changes.','Supply travel takes longer.','Clean wind powers upper decks.'],['Blue Meridian','Polar estuary','frozen',83,78,'A frozen river runs uphill under blue ice, carrying southern seeds.','Cold draws extra fuel.','Ice preserves delicate specimens.'],['Nacre Commons','Coastal commons','coastal',62,79,'Shell-bright homes where every decision is still made at a shared table.','Crowding strains communal trust.','Strong social bonds ease recruitment.'],['Rootglass','Living labyrinth','mycelial',39,82,'Translucent roots grow around the foundations of an earlier civilization.','Pathways shift after rain.','Exceptional inherited traits emerge.'],['Far Witness','Orbital crater','lunar',24,80,'An observatory at the last reliable horizon. Something below counts the stars.','Isolated and costly to supply.','The final evidence reframes the archive.']
].map((x,i)=>({id:i,name:x[0],biome:x[1],climate:x[2],x:x[3],y:x[4],desc:x[5],hazard:x[6],bonus:x[7]}));
const RAW=[
['A Garden That Forgot Spring',0,'Curator Iven Sol','Every glass flower in the Orchard opened at once, then shed its color. Seedlings inherited the pallor.','What has actually been lost?','The recycled-water beds went pale; public beds remain bright.|One graft shares an abrupt growth-ring change three generations ago.|Curator Sol diverted mineral water after a pump failure; the report says seasonal die-off.','water,inheritance|inheritance,history|water,concealment','A water-borne mineral absence is inherited through one graft line.|The climate clock slipped out of season.|A curator hid a blight to protect the seed vault.','water,inheritance|climate,history|concealment,disease','A lineage remembers a mistake long after its maker.'],
['The Bell Beneath Cinder Quay',1,'Dockmaster Yara Venn','A bell rings beneath the tidal foundry at low water. Each ring precedes a convoy manifest disappearing.','Who—or what—is ringing it?','Fresh copper filings match the old quay clockwork.|Lost manifests were copied in ink traced with cellar blue-salt.|The clapper moves when water crosses an old drain mark.','machine,history|concealment,route|water,machine','A flooded clockwork sluice rings; the manifest theft is a human cover.|A dockworker signals a smuggling route.|An old harbor calendar predicts arrivals by sound.','machine,water|concealment,route|history,route','Infrastructure leaves a louder testimony than its builders.'],
['Voices in the Fold',2,'Surveyor Oru Kest','The Fold repeats three missing surveyors. Kest hears a sister who never visited. The echoes answer unasked questions.','What is the Fold repeating?','A recorder captured an answer before its question.|The phrase belonged to a childhood game; Kest’s family seedlings repeat its rhythm.|Hollow mineral tubes vibrate with groundwater, not speech.','resonance,memory|inheritance,memory|geology,resonance','Geological resonance is interpreted through inherited memory.|The Fold preserves recordings of the missing team.|Kest planted evidence to halt expansion.','geology,inheritance,resonance|memory,resonance|concealment,memory','A voice can be an inheritance without being a ghost.'],
['The Grass That Turned Away',3,'Ranger Tavi Renn','Glass grass turned from settlement and cut the northern well route. At dusk it follows a silent figure.','What is steering the grass?','Iron-rich dust from an old rig matches particles in root tips.|The figure appears only in a beacon lens reflection.|Family maps show the grass turning after a well was sealed.','ecology,machine|light,machine|water,history','A reflected beacon pulse steers iron-sensitive plants toward a sealed well.|A migrating species follows seasonal groundwater.|Renn invented a figure to keep settlers off the steppe.','light,machine,water|ecology,water|concealment,history','The frontier’s compass is an old decision made visible.'],
['The Index of Unborn Names',4,'Archivist Jun Aro','The Vault engine returns names of children not yet born, including descendants of a supposedly childless family.','What is the engine predicting?','The index mistakes rootstock lineage tables for a census.|The family adopted two children after a transport accident; no public record exists.|Four possible names appear, only one marked with a living-seed symbol.','machine,inheritance|history,concealment|machine,ecology','A damaged model confuses seed lineages and a concealed adoption with a census.|The Vault calculates births from genetic traits.|Aro altered the index to expose an unrecorded family.','machine,inheritance,history|machine,ecology|concealment,history','Prediction is not destiny; it is what we bothered to count.'],
['A Door for the Wind',5,'Builder Sera Voss','Sable Aerie doors open by themselves at midnight, always facing the wind. One night a locked nursery opened against a gale.','Why do the doors choose their direction?','Wind-responsive alloy hinges share one workshop batch.|The nursery’s sleep-song matches the cliff wind harps.|A late mentor’s pressure-release mechanism was omitted from public plans.','machine,inheritance|sound,ecology|history,concealment','An old pressure safeguard in a shared alloy follows wind changes.|A living wind organism speaks through the walls.|Voss tests an evacuation design without consent.','machine,inheritance,history|ecology,sound|concealment,machine','A safeguard can outlive the danger and still ask to be understood.'],
['The River That Climbed',6,'Icekeeper Nemi Daal','Blue Meridian water reversed direction, carrying southern seeds uphill. Daal says the river is returning what it borrowed.','What drives the reversal?','A geothermal fissure changes pressure during the long dusk.|Seed shells carry salt from Cinder Quay tidal flats.|Daal’s heat-releasing frost graft spread beyond the settlement.','climate,geology|route,ecology|inheritance,climate','A geothermal dusk pulse and inherited heat graft reverse the flow.|A colony pump moves seeds uphill.|A hidden ocean tide connects the river to Cinder Quay.','geology,inheritance,climate|machine,route|route,climate','A useful trait can become an ecosystem before anyone notices.'],
['The Table of Empty Chairs',7,'Mediator Eno Vale','Six Commons chairs remain empty each evening. Their households opposed the ration plan; kitchens withhold their meals.','Why are the chairs empty?','Six households get less than allotment; signatures use a second ink.|A drought-resistant grain was reserved for families with children.|Old voting rules allow abstention but forbid reallocating meals.','concealment,food|inheritance,food|history,trust','Kitchen stewards redirected rations under a paternalistic rule and forged signatures.|The households chose a protest fast.|An obsolete charter makes an allocation appear unlawful.','concealment,food,trust|food,inheritance|history,trust','Care without consent can resemble control.'],
['The Rootglass Cartographer',8,'Mycologist Fara Noll','A living root network redrew the foundation map. Noll recognizes her late mother’s handwriting in its pattern.','What is the map recording?','The root pattern matches Noll’s mother’s supposedly sterile ship graft.|Old map lines point to foundations predating the landing date.|Rain changes the pattern; roots react to runoff from a sealed chamber.','inheritance,ecology|history,geology|water,ecology','An inherited graft maps concealed foundations through mineral signals.|Noll forged her mother’s private map.|Native roots warn of the lower chamber.','inheritance,history,ecology|concealment,history|ecology,water','An inheritance can be a map, but maps do not tell us what to do.'],
['The Last Star in Far Witness',9,'Observer Kio Renn','One star vanished from every instrument but remains visible to the naked eye. Below, something counts colony lights.','What has gone missing?','An old lens has a duplicated constellation hiding the star behind the ridge.|The underground counter stops at 4,812, the recorded descendants.|A buried transmitter returns settlement lights after a long delay.','light,history|inheritance,machine|machine,memory','A ridge and lens hide a delayed reflection; the counter indexes inherited records.|A distant intelligence erases stars to measure the colony.|Renn falsified instruments to summon rescue.','light,history,inheritance,machine|machine,memory|concealment,history','A world may count us without knowing what a number is for.'],
['A Clock in the Seed Vault',0,'Seedkeeper Mael','The vault opens one minute before every quake. Seedlings have begun opening too.','What learned to anticipate the tremor?','Seed roots vibrate before the seismic alarm.|An old clock draws from the same fault sensor.|The quake log was shifted one day in maintenance.','ecology,resonance|machine,geology|history,concealment','A shared fault-sensor circuit links roots and clock.|Plants inherited a geological warning.|A caretaker changes logs to hide a quake.','ecology,machine,geology|inheritance,geology|concealment,history','A warning can pass from machine to living thing.'],
['Salt on the Bell Rope',1,'Dockhand Rei','The rope is dry, but salt appears on the hands of anyone who touches it.','Where does the salt come from?','Crystals match the brackish lower channel.|A glove shows a thin copper abrasion.|The channel gate opens on nights the bell rings.','water,history|machine,concealment|route,water','A pressure leak carries salt up the bell shaft.|A worker rubs salt into the rope.|The tide is making a natural signal.','water,machine|concealment,history|water,ecology','The smallest residue can carry a whole route.'],
['The Unfinished Echo',2,'Listener Oru','A voice repeats a sentence nobody remembers, then stops before its final word.','Why does the echo remain unfinished?','A memory crystal has a broken final segment.|The sound repeats with ground pressure.|A child’s notebook finishes the phrase differently.','machine,memory|geology,resonance|inheritance,memory','Damaged recording and resonant stone combine into a false memory.|The valley invites listeners to finish an inherited phrase.|A surveyor edited a warning.','machine,geology,resonance|inheritance,memory|concealment,history','Memory is a collaboration between trace and listener.'],
['A Compass with No North',3,'Ranger Senn','Every compass points to buried grass, even after its needle is removed.','What is the compass actually following?','Iron roots form a ring below the field.|A sealed well map is hidden in an old ranger case.|The field changes when the beacon lens is uncovered.','ecology,machine|water,history|light,machine','The mineral ring and beacon distort navigation toward the old well.|A compass follows the seasonal water table.|A ranger hid a transmitter.','ecology,machine,water|water,ecology|concealment,machine','Every direction is made from what we choose to trust.'],
['The Vault’s Second Index',4,'Archivist Em','An overnight index lists books by the person most likely to disagree with them.','What is the index sorting?','The engine reads marginal notes as author names.|Several notes share inherited family shorthand.|Predictions change when a book is removed.','machine,history|inheritance,memory|machine,ecology','The index sorts inherited annotations, not future opinions.|An archivist tags dissenters for surveillance.|Books respond to being removed.','machine,inheritance,history|concealment,trust|ecology,memory','A catalogue can accidentally become a portrait of its keepers.'],
['The Wind’s Small Reply',5,'Harphand Tavi','Wind harps play a melody matching the shape of a child’s leaf-pattern birthmark.','What links melody and mark?','Both patterns follow the same pressure cycle.|The child inherited a rare ridge-sensing trait.|One harp wire came from a salvaged navigation strand.','sound,climate|inheritance,sound|machine,history','An inherited sensitivity renders pressure vibrations in growth.|The child copies a tune heard in sleep.|The caretaker repairs the harp to signal evacuation.','sound,inheritance,climate|memory,sound|concealment,machine','A trait is a conversation between body and surroundings.'],
['The Warm Ice',6,'Icekeeper Sol','A patch melts in the shape of a family crest, then freezes over before dawn.','What makes the crest?','Heat follows a buried geothermal seam.|The crest matches a frost-graft nursery mark.|The ice contains salt from a southern shipment.','geology,climate|inheritance,climate|route,water','An inherited graft warms ice along a mineral seam.|Colonists carved the crest as a memorial.|A transported seed releases heat.','geology,inheritance,climate|history,memory|route,ecology','The past can leave a shape without leaving a command.'],
['A Vote Cast Twice',7,'Mediator Isen','A household’s vote appears twice, once on each side of a ration amendment.','Why was the vote duplicated?','The ledger restored an unmerged backup.|The household abstained but had submitted a proxy.|Two ink marks belong to two generations.','machine,history|trust,history|inheritance,trust','A proxy and stale backup recorded one divided household.|A steward forged a tie to delay the vote.|Descendants are being counted as voters.','machine,trust,history|concealment,trust|inheritance,history','A family can contain more than one answer.'],
['The Rain That Knows a Name',8,'Mycologist Lio','After rain, a name appears in Rootglass then disappears before it can be copied.','What writes and erases the name?','Runoff exposes a buried inscription.|The name belongs to an unregistered foundation worker.|Roots cover it again each dry cycle.','water,history|concealment,history|ecology,water','Runoff reveals a concealed worker’s name and living roots erase it.|A mycelial organism learns human writing.|A cartographer projects a temporary image.','water,history,ecology|ecology,memory|machine,concealment','A missing name can remain in a place that never learned to read.'],
['The Crater’s Quiet Count',9,'Observer Vale','The underground counter skips a number whenever someone decides to leave the colony.','What does the counter measure?','Its input is a departures ledger, not a light sensor.|A child changed the gear to match the ship bell.|The skipped number belongs to an unregistered passenger.','machine,history|sound,mechanism|concealment,inheritance','The machine counts recorded departures but omits a hidden passenger.|It measures intention through fear responses.|A saboteur erased the travel record.','machine,history,concealment|memory,ecology|concealment,history','Counting is never neutral when someone is left out.']
];
const CASES=RAW.map((r,i)=>{const ev=r[5].split('|'),et=r[6].split('|'),th=r[7].split('|'),tt=r[8].split('|');return {title:r[0],region:r[1],person:r[2],intro:r[3],question:r[4],evidence:ev.map((text,j)=>({name:text.split('. ')[0].slice(0,48)+(text.split('. ')[0].length>48?'…':''),text:text.split('. ').map(s=>s.trim()).join('. '),tags:et[j].split(',')})),theories:th.map((label,j)=>({label,tags:tt[j].split(',')})),lesson:r[9]}});
const TRAITS=[['mycelial','Mycelial Recall','❋','Root networks retain mineral traces; living biomes reveal extra insight.','Evidence clarity +1 in Rootglass; field insight cost −1.'],['saltglass','Saltglass Skin','◈','A brackish adaptation preserves water through long, dry crossings.','Water loss −1 each cycle.'],['windvein','Windvein','⌁','Fine air-sensing filaments feed power into highland settlements.','Power generation +1.'],['duskbloom','Duskbloom','✿','Flowers store the last light as a modest food reserve.','Food generation +1.'],['resonant','Resonant Bone','♫','A mineralized trait detects hollow chambers and quiet machinery.','Investigation insight cost −1.'],['frostgraft','Frost Graft','❄','Cold-tolerant stems insulate stores and survive polar crossings.','Fuel loss −1 in cold frontier.'],['ironroot','Ironroot','♧','Roots draw trace metals from exhausted soil.','Supply expeditions return +1 material.'],['clearwing','Clearwing','⌖','Transparent leaf veining scatters light into optical signals.','Research yields +1 insight.'],['tideturn','Tideturn','≈','A pressure-sensitive bloom forecasts coastal changes.','Routes lose fewer resources.'],['lumenlace','Lumenlace','✧','A blue filament glows when air quality begins to fail.','Early warning prevents a habitat penalty.']].map(x=>({id:x[0],name:x[1],icon:x[2],desc:x[3],effect:x[4]}));
const MILESTONES=[['First Print','Resolve the first case.'],['Root Record','Collect three clues.'],['The Second Landing','Open a second region.'],['Shared Table','Reach trust 5.'],['Living Index','Cultivate an inherited trait.'],['Quiet Convoy','Establish a supply route.'],['The Far Register','Resolve five cases.'],['Crossed Lineage','Cross a hybrid.'],['A City of Glass','Reach population 12.'],['An Unsealed Chamber','Resolve ten cases.'],['Good Neighbors','Reach trust 8.'],['Many Hands','Complete five studies.'],['The Ninth Garden','Open the ninth region.'],['Remembered Safeguard','Discover Lumenlace.'],['The Missing Name','Resolve fifteen cases.'],['Listening Charter','Choose communal testimony.'],['A Deliberate Map','Survey six regions.'],['Steward of Seeds','Ecology reaches 8.'],['Aster’s Key','Discover ten traits.'],['The Second Future','Lineage reaches 7.'],['Old Work, New Hands','Complete ten studies.'],['A Quiet Year','Survive five cycles without crisis.'],['Open Archive','Collect thirty traces.'],['Nacre’s Answer','Trust 8 after five cases.'],['A World Inherited','Resolve all twenty cases.'],['Three Branches','Advance each research branch twice.'],['Far Witness','Open the last region.'],['No Name Left Out','Record a communal conclusion.'],['Green Thread','Complete four habitat projects.'],['Elsewhere, Chosen','Complete the ending.']].map((x,i)=>({name:x[0],desc:x[1]}));
const BRANCHES=[{id:'field',name:'Fieldcraft',icon:'⌕',desc:'Better reading, safer routes, deeper evidence.',perks:['Clue cost −0.35 per study','Survey yields a trace of insight','Gain an inference point','Supported cases return insight']},{id:'civic',name:'Civic Weave',icon:'♧',desc:'Trust, shared rules, resilient communities.',perks:['A disputed conclusion protects trust','Council studies cost less','Shared accounts provide extra supplies','Trusted communities grow sooner']},{id:'living',name:'Living Science',icon:'❋',desc:'Inherited traits as tools, not destiny.',perks:['Lineage clues surface sooner','Hybrid crosses stabilize new traits','Living beds produce more food','Rare traits emerge on surveys']}];
const DIFF={gentle:{name:'Sheltered',cost:.75,drain:.65,penalty:.65},standard:{name:'Measured',cost:1,drain:1,penalty:1},severe:{name:'Unforgiving',cost:1.35,drain:1.4,penalty:1.4}};
const KEY='verdigris-save-v1';let S=null,view='frontier',region=0,theory=0,timer=0,ctx=null;
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c])),clamp=(n,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,n));
function fresh(diff){return {v:1,difficulty:diff,cycle:1,done:[],active:0,found:{},resources:{food:14,water:16,power:13,insight:6,materials:7},stats:{trust:5,ecology:6,population:8,lineage:1,health:8},open:[0],surveyed:[0],routes:[],traits:['mycelial'],genes:[],branches:{field:0,civic:0,living:0},research:[],projects:[],events:[],milestones:[],crises:0,communal:0,clues:0,ending:null,settings:{music:true,sfx:true,musicVolume:.22,sfxVolume:.6},streak:0}}
function load(){try{let a=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));if(a&&a.v===1&&a.resources&&Array.isArray(a.done))return a}catch(e){console.warn('Save unavailable',e)}return null}
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(S))}catch(e){notice('Save storage is unavailable. Export your archive.')}}
function notice(t){let x=$('toast');x.textContent=t;x.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>x.classList.remove('show'),2300)}
function sound(discovery){if(!S||!S.settings.sfx)return;try{ctx=ctx||new(window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();ctx.resume();let t=ctx.currentTime,g=ctx.createGain(),o=ctx.createOscillator();g.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,t);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime((discovery?.11:.055)*(S.settings.sfxVolume??.6),t+.02);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,t+(discovery?.65:.2));g.connect(ctx.destination);o.type='sine';o.frequency.setValueAtTime(discovery?520:400,t);o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(discovery?820:170,t+.18);o.connect(g);o.start(t);o.stop(t+.55);if(discovery){let o2=ctx.createOscillator();o2.frequency.value=1040;o2.type='triangle';o2.connect(g);o2.start(t+.12);o2.stop(t+.56)}}catch(e){}}
function ambiance(){let a=$('ambience');if(S&&S.settings.music){a.volume=S.settings.musicVolume??.22;a.play().catch(()=>{})}else a.pause()}
function amt(k){return S.resources[k]||0}function add(k,n){S.resources[k]=clamp((S.resources[k]||0)+n,0,99)}function log(title,text){S.events.push({cycle:S.cycle,title,text});if(S.events.length>100)S.events.shift()}
function production(k){let n=k==='food'||k==='power'?1:0;if(k==='food'&&S.traits.includes('duskbloom'))n++;if(k==='food'&&S.branches.living>=3)n++;if(k==='power'&&S.traits.includes('windvein'))n++;return n}
function upkeep(k){let n=k==='food'?2:k==='water'?2:1;if(k==='food'&&S.stats.population>10)n++;if(k==='power'&&S.open.length>5)n++;if(k==='water'&&S.traits.includes('saltglass'))n--;if(k==='power'&&S.traits.includes('windvein'))n--;if(k==='power'&&S.traits.includes('frostgraft')&&REGIONS.some(r=>S.open.includes(r.id)&&r.climate==='frozen'))n--;return Math.max(0,Math.ceil(n*DIFF[S.difficulty].drain))}
function render(){if(!S)return;let rs=[['food','✿','FOOD'],['water','≈','WATER'],['power','ϟ','POWER'],['insight','⌕','INSIGHT'],['materials','◈','MAT.']];$('resources').innerHTML=rs.map(x=>'<div class="res"><i>'+x[1]+'</i><b>'+Math.floor(amt(x[0]))+'</b><small>'+x[2]+'</small></div>').join('');$('case-count').textContent=String(S.done.length+1).padStart(2,'0');document.querySelectorAll('nav button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.view===view));$('root').innerHTML=view==='frontier'?frontier():view==='case'?casebook():view==='inheritance'?inheritance():view==='supply'?supply():archive();bind()}
function heading(k,title,desc,right){return '<div class="heading"><div><span class="kicker">'+k+'</span><h2>'+title+'</h2><p>'+desc+'</p></div><span class="tag">'+right+'</span></div>'}
function frontier(){let r=REGIONS[region],cs=CASES.map((c,i)=>({c,i})).filter(x=>x.c.region===region),cur=cs.find(x=>!S.done.includes(x.i)),lines=REGIONS.slice(0,-1).map((x,i)=>'<line x1="'+x.x+'%" y1="'+x.y+'%" x2="'+REGIONS[i+1].x+'%" y2="'+REGIONS[i+1].y+'%" stroke="#ddc78b" stroke-width=".4" stroke-dasharray="1.2 1.2"/>').join('');let nodes=REGIONS.map((x,i)=>'<button class="node '+(S.open.includes(i)?'':'locked')+' '+(region===i?'selected':'')+'" style="left:'+x.x+'%;top:'+x.y+'%" data-region="'+i+'"><span class="orb">'+(S.open.includes(i)?String(i+1).padStart(2,'0'):'·')+'</span><span class="node-name">'+x.name+'</span><span class="node-state">'+(S.open.includes(i)?(S.surveyed.includes(i)?'SURVEYED':'OPEN'):'SEALED')+'</span></button>').join('');let current= S.open.includes(region);return heading('CHARTED FRONTIER','The living map','Cycle '+S.cycle+' · '+S.stats.population+' residents · '+S.stats.trust+' civic trust','CASE '+String(S.done.length+1).padStart(2,'0')+' / 20')+(S.ending?'<div class="banner"><span class="kicker">CAMPAIGN COMPLETE</span><h2>'+S.ending.title+'</h2><p>'+S.ending.text+'</p><button class="btn" data-action="credits">Final record</button></div>':'')+'<div class="layout"><section class="map"><div class="map-bg"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">'+lines+'</svg><div class="legend">FIELD CARTOGRAPHY<small>Each landing widens the living frontier</small></div>'+nodes+'</section><aside class="stack"><div class="panel dark"><span class="micro">'+(current?'REGION '+String(region+1).padStart(2,'0'):'SEALED TERRITORY')+'</span><h3>'+r.name+'</h3><p>'+(current?r.desc:'Resolve open investigations to establish a safe route.')+'</p><div class="row"><span>ECOSYSTEM</span><strong>'+r.biome+'</strong></div><div class="row"><span>CONDITION</span><strong>'+r.hazard+'</strong></div><div class="row"><span>ADVANTAGE</span><strong>'+r.bonus+'</strong></div>'+(current?'<div class="actions"><button class="btn fill" data-action="survey" data-i="'+region+'" '+(S.surveyed.includes(region)?'disabled':'')+'>'+(S.surveyed.includes(region)?'Surveyed':'Survey · 2 insight')+'</button>'+(cur?'<button class="btn" data-action="investigate" data-i="'+cur.i+'">Open casebook</button>':'')+'</div>':'')+'</div><div class="panel"><span class="micro">THIS CYCLE</span><h3>A small world, still changing</h3><p>'+eventLine()+'</p><div class="row"><span>GENERATION</span><strong>Food +'+production('food')+' · Power +'+production('power')+'</strong></div><div class="row"><span>CASES HERE</span><strong>'+cs.filter(x=>S.done.includes(x.i)).length+'/'+cs.length+'</strong></div></div></aside></div><p class="kicker">'+S.done.length+' / 20 inquiries · '+S.clues+' traces · automatic local save</p>'}
function eventLine(){if(S.stats.ecology<3)return 'Habitat is under strain. A living project can prevent further loss.';if(S.stats.trust<3)return 'The council is divided. Shared testimony can mend trust.';if(amt('food')<4)return 'Food stores are low; recover supplies before advancing.';return ['A pale wind combs the greenhouse roofs.','The old hull sings at dusk.','An unfamiliar seedling appears beside the pump.','A route marker turns toward the eastern ridge.'][S.cycle%4]}
function evidenceCount(i){return S.found[i]||[]}
function casebook(){let i=S.active,c=CASES[i],found=evidenceCount(i),resolved=S.done.includes(i),enough=found.length>=2;if(!c)return heading('FIELD NOTES','No remaining leads','The archive is complete.','END');let clues=c.evidence.map((e,j)=>'<button class="clue '+(found.includes(j)?'found':'')+'" data-action="clue" data-j="'+j+'" '+(found.includes(j)||resolved?'disabled':'')+'><span class="kicker">'+(found.includes(j)?'✦':String(j+1).padStart(2,'0'))+'</span><span><strong>'+e.name+'</strong>'+(found.includes(j)?'<p>'+e.text+'</p><small>TRACE · '+e.tags.join(' / ')+'</small>':'')+'</span><small>'+(found.includes(j)?'RECORDED':'−'+clueCost().toFixed(1)+' INSIGHT')+'</small></button>').join('');let theories=c.theories.map((t,j)=>'<button class="theory '+(theory===j?'selected':'')+'" data-theory="'+j+'" '+(resolved?'disabled':'')+'><small>Interpretation '+['I','II','III'][j]+'</small>'+t.label+'</button>').join('');return heading('ACTIVE INQUIRY',c.title,'Field investigator '+c.person+' · '+REGIONS[c.region].name,'CASE '+String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')+' / 20')+'<div class="case-layout"><div><section class="scene"><div class="meta"><span>'+REGIONS[c.region].biome+'</span><span>⟡ '+found.length+'/3 traces</span></div><h3>'+c.question+'</h3><p>'+c.intro+'</p></section><div class="panel" style="margin-top:13px"><span class="micro">OBSERVATIONS · SPEND INSIGHT TO ENTER THE SCENE</span><div class="evidence">'+clues+'</div></div></div><aside class="stack"><div class="panel"><span class="micro">THREE POSSIBLE READINGS</span><h3>What the colony records</h3><p>Inspect at least two traces before recording a conclusion. Full testimony requires all three.</p><div class="row"><span>INSIGHT</span><strong>'+Math.floor(amt('insight'))+'</strong></div>'+theories+'<div class="actions"><button class="btn fill" data-action="resolve" '+(enough&&!resolved?'':'disabled')+'>'+(resolved?'Inquiry resolved':enough?'Record conclusion':'Find two traces')+'</button><button class="btn" data-action="communal" '+(found.length>=3&&!resolved?'':'disabled')+'>Hear all accounts</button></div></div><div class="panel dark"><span class="micro">FIELD QUESTION</span><h3>'+c.person+'</h3><p>“'+c.lesson+'”</p></div></aside></div>'}
function clueCost(){return Math.max(.5,2-S.branches.field*.35-(S.traits.includes('resonant')?1:0)-(S.traits.includes('mycelial')?.5:0))*DIFF[S.difficulty].cost}
function inheritance(){let traits=S.traits.map(id=>TRAITS.find(t=>t.id===id)).filter(Boolean),next=TRAITS.filter(t=>!S.traits.includes(t.id)),pending=S.genes.map(id=>TRAITS.find(t=>t.id===id)).filter(Boolean);return heading('LIVING SCIENCE','Inheritance is a choice','Cultivated traits alter habitats, supplies, research, and fieldwork.','LINEAGE '+S.stats.lineage)+'<div class="branch-grid">'+BRANCHES.map(b=>'<div class="branch"><span class="kicker">'+b.icon+' RESEARCH · '+S.branches[b.id]+'/4</span><h3>'+b.name+'</h3><p>'+b.desc+'</p><div class="row"><span>NEXT STUDY</span><strong>'+ (b.perks[S.branches[b.id]]||'Complete')+'</strong></div><button class="btn" data-action="research" data-id="'+b.id+'" '+(S.branches[b.id]>=4?'disabled':'')+'>Study · '+Math.max(1,2+S.branches[b.id]-(S.branches.civic>=2?1:0))+' insight, 1 power</button></div>').join('')+'</div><div class="heading"><div><span class="kicker">FIELD GUIDE · '+traits.length+'/10</span><h2 style="font-size:30px">A field guide to becoming</h2></div></div><div class="cards">'+traits.map(t=>'<article class="gene"><div class="glyph">'+t.icon+'</div><span class="kicker">ESTABLISHED TRAIT</span><h3>'+t.name+'</h3><p>'+t.desc+'</p><div class="row"><span>FIELD EFFECT</span><strong>'+t.effect+'</strong></div><button class="btn" data-action="cultivate" data-id="'+t.id+'">Cultivate · 2 materials</button></article>').join('')+next.slice(0,Math.max(1,10-traits.length)).map((t,i)=>'<article class="gene" style="opacity:.58"><div class="glyph">'+['✣','❧','✺','⌘','☼'][i%5]+'</div><span class="kicker">UNREAD GENOME</span><h3>Uncatalogued inheritance</h3><p>Resolve inquiries and survey open habitats to reveal a distinct lineage.</p></article>').join('')+pending.map(t=>'<article class="gene"><span class="kicker">GENOME DISCOVERED</span><h3>'+t.name+'</h3><p>'+t.desc+'</p><button class="btn" data-action="cultivate" data-id="'+t.id+'">Cultivate · 2 materials</button></article>').join('')+'</div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:16px"><span class="micro">HYBRID CULTIVATION</span><h3>Cross two established traits</h3><p>Three materials and two insight raise lineage and population; the Living Science branch favors novel hybrids. Crosses interact with the ecosystem and available traits.</p><button class="btn fill" data-action="hybrid" '+(S.traits.length<2||amt('materials')<3||amt('insight')<2?'disabled':'')+'>Crossbreed · 3 materials, 2 insight</button><div class="row"><span>HERITAGE DEPTH</span><strong>'+S.stats.lineage+' generations</strong></div></div>'}
function supply(){let ks=[['food','Food','✿',24],['water','Water','≈',24],['power','Power','ϟ',20],['insight','Insight','⌕',15],['materials','Materials','◈',20]];let routes=S.routes.length?S.routes.map(i=>'<div class="row"><span><strong>'+REGIONS[i].name+'</strong><br>'+REGIONS[i].climate+' · one cycle each way</span><button class="btn" data-action="route-remove" data-i="'+i+'">Close</button></div>').join(''):'<p>No established routes. Survey a region before opening a convoy.';let tiles=[['food','Gather edible blooms','−1 power · +4 food'],['water','Reclaim runoff','−1 power · +4 water'],['materials','Salvage the old hull','−2 power · +3 materials'],['insight','Study a living sample','−1 food · +3 insight']];return heading('COLONY STEWARDSHIP','The long supply line','Each cycle consumes stores. Expeditions, habitats, research, traits, and trust change what reaches the frontier.','CYCLE '+S.cycle)+'<div class="supply"><section class="panel"><span class="micro">SHARED RESERVES</span><h3>What the colony can spare</h3><div class="stock-grid">'+ks.map(k=>'<div class="stock"><span>'+k[2]+' '+k[1]+'</span><div class="track"><i style="width:'+clamp(amt(k[0])/k[3]*100,0,100)+'%;background:'+(amt(k[0])<4?'var(--rust)':'var(--moss)')+'"></i></div><strong>'+Math.floor(amt(k[0]))+'</strong></div>').join('')+'</div><div class="row"><span>UPKEEP</span><strong>−'+upkeep('food')+' food · −'+upkeep('water')+' water · −'+upkeep('power')+' power</strong></div><div class="tiles">'+tiles.map(x=>'<button class="tile" data-action="gather" data-id="'+x[0]+'"><strong>'+x[1]+'</strong><small>'+x[2]+' · advances a cycle</small></button>').join('')+'</div></section><aside class="stack"><div class="panel"><span class="micro">ROUTE NETWORK · '+S.routes.length+'/9</span><h3>Supply out and back</h3><p>Each active link adds one food and water at the next cycle; every route also increases colony consumption pressure.</p>'+routes+'<div class="chips">'+REGIONS.map((r,i)=>i===0?'':'<button class="chip" data-action="route-add" data-i="'+i+'" '+(!S.open.includes(i)||!S.surveyed.includes(i)||S.routes.includes(i)||amt('materials')<2?'disabled':'')+'><strong>'+r.name+'</strong><small>'+(!S.open.includes(i)?'SEALED':!S.surveyed.includes(i)?'SURVEY REQUIRED':S.routes.includes(i)?'LINKED':'2 MATERIALS · OPEN')+'</small></button>').join('')+'</div></div><div class="panel dark"><span class="micro">COLONY CONDITION</span><h3>Keep the living balance</h3>'+[['Civic trust',S.stats.trust],['Ecological health',S.stats.ecology],['Habitat health',S.stats.health],['Population',S.stats.population]].map(x=>'<div class="row"><span>'+x[0]+'</span><strong>'+x[1]+'/10</strong></div>').join('')+'<p>Shortages damage habitat; low ecology cuts yields. Routes, recovery and cultivated traits can turn a liability into an advantage.</p><button class="btn" data-action="advance">Advance one cycle</button></div></aside></div>'}
function archive(){let ev=S.events.slice().reverse().slice(0,24),obj=[['Resolve the next inquiry',S.done.length>=20],['Survey six frontiers',S.surveyed.length>=6],['Build a living lineage',S.stats.lineage>=5],['Keep ecology above 5',S.stats.ecology>=5],['Maintain trust above 5',S.stats.trust>=5],['Open a supply route',S.routes.length>0]];return heading('THE COLONY RECORD','What we chose to keep','A persistent field archive of discoveries, decisions, and consequences.',S.done.length+'/20 CASES')+'<div class="supply"><section class="panel"><span class="micro">CHRONICLE · CYCLE '+S.cycle+'</span><h3>The record changes with us</h3><div class="timeline">'+(ev.length?ev.map(e=>'<div class="entry"><time>CYCLE '+e.cycle+'</time><div><strong>'+esc(e.title)+'</strong><p>'+esc(e.text)+'</p></div></div>').join(''):'<p>Your first note will appear when you step beyond the landing garden.</p>')+'</div></section><aside class="stack"><div class="panel"><span class="micro">SHORT & LONG HORIZONS</span><h3>A field office’s work</h3><ul class="objectives">'+obj.map(x=>'<li class="'+(x[1]?'done':'')+'">'+x[0]+'</li>').join('')+'</ul><div class="row"><span>CASES</span><strong>'+S.done.length+'/20</strong></div><div class="row"><span>TRACES</span><strong>'+S.clues+'/60</strong></div><div class="row"><span>CYCLES</span><strong>'+S.cycle+'</strong></div></div><div class="panel"><span class="micro">STEWARDSHIP</span><h3>Local save, this browser</h3><p>Progress saves automatically. Export a JSON backup or clear this expedition.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn" data-action="export">Export save</button><button class="btn" data-action="settings">Sound & controls</button><button class="btn" data-action="reset">New expedition</button></div></div><div class="panel dark"><span class="micro">MILESTONES · '+S.milestones.length+'/30</span><h3>Field accomplishments</h3><div class="milestones">'+MILESTONES.map((m,i)=>'<div class="milestone '+(S.milestones.includes(i)?'':'locked')+'"><span>'+(S.milestones.includes(i)?'✦':'◇')+'</span><div><strong>'+m.name+'</strong><small>'+m.desc+'</small></div></div>').join('')+'</div><button class="btn" data-action="credits">Credits & field notes</button></div></aside></div>'}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{view=b.dataset.view;render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-region]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let i=+b.dataset.region;if(!S.open.includes(i)){notice('The frontier beyond is not settled.');return}region=i;sound();render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-theory]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{theory=+b.dataset.theory;sound();render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>action(b.dataset.action,b.dataset))}
function action(a,d){sound(false);let i=+(d.i||0);if(a==='investigate'){S.active=i;theory=0;view='case';render()}else if(a==='clue')findClue(+d.j);else if(a==='resolve')resolve(false);else if(a==='communal')resolve(true);else if(a==='survey')survey(i);else if(a==='gather')gather(d.id);else if(a==='advance'){advance();save();render()}else if(a==='research')research(d.id);else if(a==='cultivate')cultivate(d.id);else if(a==='hybrid')hybrid();else if(a==='route-add')addRoute(i);else if(a==='route-remove'){S.routes=S.routes.filter(x=>x!==i);log('Route withdrawn','The convoy to '+REGIONS[i].name+' returned to local service.');save();render()}else if(a==='export')exportSave();else if(a==='settings')settingsModal();else if(a==='reset')resetModal();else if(a==='credits')credits()}
function findClue(j){let i=S.active,c=CASES[i],found=evidenceCount(i);if(found.includes(j))return;if(amt('insight')<clueCost()){notice('Not enough insight. Study a sample or cultivate Resonant Bone.');return}add('insight',-clueCost());S.found[i]=found.concat(j);S.clues++;sound(true);log('Trace recorded',c.evidence[j].name+' — '+REGIONS[c.region].name+'.');if((S.branches.living>=1?S.clues%3===0:S.clues%4===0)){let t=TRAITS.find(x=>!S.traits.includes(x.id)&&!S.genes.includes(x.id));if(t){S.genes.push(t.id);notice('Lineage trace: '+t.name+' is ready to cultivate.')}}milestones();save();render()}
function resolve(comm){let i=S.active,c=CASES[i],f=evidenceCount(i);if(f.length<(comm?3:2)||S.done.includes(i))return;let scores=c.theories.map(t=>f.reduce((n,j)=>n+c.evidence[j].tags.filter(x=>t.tags.includes(x)).length,0)),score=scores[theory]+(S.branches.field>=3?1:0),best=Math.max.apply(null,scores),correct=score>=Math.max(2,best-1);S.done.push(i);S.stats.trust=clamp(S.stats.trust+(comm?2:correct?1:S.branches.civic>=1?0:-1),0,10);S.stats.ecology=clamp(S.stats.ecology+(correct?1:-1),0,10);add('insight',comm?2:correct?2:0);if(correct&&S.branches.field>=4)add('insight',1);add('materials',comm?2:correct?1:0);if(comm&&S.branches.civic>=3){add('food',1);add('materials',1)}if(comm){S.communal++;S.stats.population++;add('food',2)}else if(correct){S.stats.lineage++;if(S.stats.lineage%3===0)S.stats.population++}else S.stats.health=clamp(S.stats.health-1,0,10);if(S.done.length%2===0&&S.open.length<10){let next=S.open.length;S.open.push(next);S.stats.population++;region=next;log('New landing established',REGIONS[next].name+' is reachable. '+REGIONS[next].bonus)}if(!S.surveyed.includes(c.region))S.surveyed.push(c.region);log(correct?'A conclusion entered':'A provisional conclusion entered',c.title+': '+(comm?'a communal account records all voices.':correct?'the evidence supports this reading.':'the colony records a contested reading.'));if(S.done.length===20)finish();milestones();advance(true);save();view='case';render();notice(comm?'Shared testimony recorded.':correct?'The evidence holds.':'A contested record; its consequences travel.')}
function survey(i){if(amt('insight')<2){notice('Surveying costs 2 insight.');return}add('insight',-2);if(!S.surveyed.includes(i))S.surveyed.push(i);S.stats.ecology=clamp(S.stats.ecology+1,0,10);let t=TRAITS.find(x=>!S.traits.includes(x.id)&&!S.genes.includes(x.id));if(S.branches.field>=2)add('insight',1);if(S.branches.living>=4)t=TRAITS[9];if(t&&!S.traits.includes(t.id)&&!S.genes.includes(t.id)&&S.genes.length<3)S.genes.push(t.id);S.projects.push(i);log('Frontier surveyed',REGIONS[i].name+': '+REGIONS[i].bonus);milestones();save();render();notice(REGIONS[i].name+' charted. Habitat trace recorded.')}
function gather(k){let cost={food:['power',1,4],water:['power',1,4],materials:['power',2,3],insight:['food',1,3]}[k];if(amt(cost[0])<cost[1]){notice('The expedition cannot spare that cost.');return}add(cost[0],-cost[1]);add(k,cost[2]+(k==='materials'&&S.traits.includes('ironroot')?1:0));advance();log('Supply recovered','Field crew brought back '+cost[2]+' '+k+'.');save();render()}
function research(id){let n=S.branches[id],cost=Math.max(1,2+n-(S.branches.civic>=2?1:0));if(n>=4||amt('insight')<cost||amt('power')<1){notice('Study needs '+cost+' insight and 1 power.');return}add('insight',-cost);add('power',-1);S.branches[id]++;S.research.push(id);if(id==='civic'&&n===1)add('food',2);if(S.traits.includes('clearwing'))add('insight',1);if(id==='living'&&S.genes.length){let g=S.genes.shift();if(!S.traits.includes(g))S.traits.push(g);notice('Research reveals '+TRAITS.find(t=>t.id===g).name)}else notice(BRANCHES.find(b=>b.id===id).name+' advanced.');log('Research completed',BRANCHES.find(b=>b.id===id).name+' · '+BRANCHES.find(b=>b.id===id).perks[n]);advance(true);milestones();save();render()}
function cultivate(id){if(amt('materials')<2){notice('Cultivation requires 2 materials.');return}if(!S.genes.includes(id)&&S.traits.includes(id)===false){notice('That genome has not been discovered.');return}add('materials',-2);S.genes=S.genes.filter(x=>x!==id);if(!S.traits.includes(id))S.traits.push(id);S.stats.ecology=clamp(S.stats.ecology+1,0,10);S.stats.lineage++;log('Trait cultivated',TRAITS.find(t=>t.id===id).name+' enters the shared habitat.');advance(true);milestones();save();render();notice('A new lineage takes root.')}
function hybrid(){if(S.traits.length<2||amt('materials')<3||amt('insight')<2)return;add('materials',-3);add('insight',-2);S.stats.lineage+=2;S.stats.population++;S.stats.ecology=clamp(S.stats.ecology+1,0,10);let seed=Math.abs(S.stats.lineage*31+S.cycle*17+S.clues*7),available=TRAITS.filter(x=>!S.traits.includes(x.id)&&!S.genes.includes(x.id)),t=available.length?available[seed%available.length]:TRAITS[seed%TRAITS.length];if(!S.traits.includes(t.id)&&!S.genes.includes(t.id)&&(S.branches.living>=2||seed%3===0)){S.genes.push(t.id);notice('Hybrid vigor discovered: '+t.name)}else notice('The cross deepened the existing lineage.');S.projects.push('hybrid');log('Lineage crossed','Two traits were cross-cultivated. Their descendants differ from either parent.');advance(true);milestones();save();render()}
function addRoute(i){if(amt('materials')<2||S.routes.includes(i)||!S.open.includes(i)||!S.surveyed.includes(i))return;add('materials',-2);S.routes.push(i);S.stats.trust=clamp(S.stats.trust+1,0,10);log('Supply route established','A convoy links '+REGIONS[i].name+' to the central habitat.');milestones();save();render()}
function advance(silent){S.cycle++;add('food',production('food')+S.routes.length);add('power',production('power'));add('water',1+(S.traits.includes('tideturn')?1:0)+S.routes.length);['food','water','power'].forEach(k=>add(k,-upkeep(k)));if(['food','water','power'].some(k=>S.resources[k]<=0)){S.stats.health=clamp(S.stats.health-1,0,10);S.crises++;S.streak=0;if(S.stats.health===0)S.stats.population=Math.max(3,S.stats.population-1);if(!silent)notice('A supply shortfall strained habitat health.');log('Supply crisis','A reserve ran dry. Habitat health fell; residents are at risk.')}else S.streak++;if(S.stats.trust<3&&S.cycle%3===0&&amt('insight')>=1){add('insight',-1);S.stats.trust=clamp(S.stats.trust+1,0,10);log('Mediator intervenes','The council mediator convened a listening circle before trust fell further.')}if(S.stats.ecology>=7&&S.cycle%2===0&&S.stats.lineage>1){add('food',1);log('Root network expands','The living habitat spread into an unused growing bed.')}if(amt('water')<5&&S.cycle%2===0&&amt('power')>1){add('power',-1);add('water',2);add('food',-1);log('Conservator reroutes runoff','An autonomous water crew changed the reclaimed-water schedule.')}if(S.routes.length&&amt('food')<5&&S.cycle%3===0){add('food',2);if(!S.traits.includes('tideturn'))add('water',-1);log('Dispatcher reprioritizes cargo','A convoy carried food at the expense of reserve water.')}if(S.stats.population>10&&S.stats.trust<4&&S.cycle%4===0){S.stats.health=clamp(S.stats.health-1,0,10);log('Residents refuse the dormitory plan','Crowding and low trust reduced habitat health.')}if(S.stats.ecology<=2){if(S.traits.includes('lumenlace')){S.stats.ecology=clamp(S.stats.ecology+1,0,10);log('Lumenlace warning','A cultivated trait prevented habitat loss.')}else S.stats.health=clamp(S.stats.health-1,0,10)}if((S.stats.trust>=8&&S.cycle%3===0)||(S.branches.civic>=4&&S.stats.trust>=7&&S.cycle%2===0)){S.stats.population++;add('food',1)}if(S.cycle%4===0){let ev=['A glass squall delays a convoy.','A seed-sharing feast raises hope.','The old hull needs a power cell.','A child finds an unmarked greenhouse door.'][Math.floor(S.cycle/4)%4];log('Frontier event',ev);if(S.cycle%8===0)S.stats.trust=clamp(S.stats.trust-1,0,10)}milestones();save()}
function milestones(){let n=S.done.length,c=[n>=1,S.clues>=3,S.open.length>=2,S.stats.trust>=5,S.traits.length>=2,S.routes.length>=1,n>=5,S.stats.lineage>=3,S.stats.population>=12,n>=10,S.stats.trust>=8,S.research.length>=5,S.open.length>=9,S.traits.includes('lumenlace'),n>=15,S.communal>=1,S.surveyed.length>=6,S.stats.ecology>=8,S.traits.length>=10,S.stats.lineage>=7,S.research.length>=10,S.streak>=5,S.clues>=30,S.stats.trust>=8&&n>=5,n>=20,S.branches.field>=2&&S.branches.civic>=2&&S.branches.living>=2,S.open.length>=10,S.communal>=1,S.projects.length>=4,!!S.ending];c.forEach((yes,i)=>{if(yes&&!S.milestones.includes(i)){S.milestones.push(i);if(i<29){add('insight',1);if(i%3===0)add('materials',1);log('Milestone · '+MILESTONES[i].name,MILESTONES[i].desc)}}})}
function finish(){S.ending=S.stats.trust>=7&&S.stats.ecology>=6?{title:'The inheritance is not an instruction.',text:'The colony publishes every account, including those that disagree. On the far ridge, a new garden takes root without a name. No one claims it. Everyone is invited to tend it.'}:{title:'A future is still a choice.',text:'The colony reaches its last frontier with its arguments intact. The record is imperfect, habitats uneven, and the next generation already asking better questions.'};log('The final frontier',S.ending.text)}
function modal(html){$('modal').innerHTML='<div class="modal-bg"><section class="modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">'+html+'</section></div>';let bg=document.querySelector('.modal-bg');bg.onclick=e=>{if(e.target===bg)closeModal()};document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>modalAction(b.dataset.modal));document.querySelectorAll('[data-volume]').forEach(x=>x.oninput=()=>{S.settings[x.dataset.volume]=+x.value;if(x.dataset.volume==='musicVolume')$('ambience').volume=+x.value;save()})}function closeModal(){$('modal').innerHTML=''}
function modalAction(a){if(a==='close')closeModal();if(a==='settings')settingsModal();if(a==='music'){S.settings.music=!S.settings.music;save();ambiance();settingsModal()}if(a==='sfx'){S.settings.sfx=!S.settings.sfx;save();settingsModal()}if(a==='export'){closeModal();exportSave()}if(a==='reset'){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);S=null;closeModal();$('game').classList.add('hidden');$('title').classList.remove('hidden');$('continue').classList.add('hidden')}}
function settingsModal(){modal('<span class="kicker">FIELD OFFICE</span><h2>Sound & controls</h2><p>Point and click to chart a region, inspect observations, compare hypotheses and steward the colony. Tab navigates; Enter activates; Escape pauses. Ambient audio and interface tones are local. Browser-local save is automatic.</p><div class="row"><span>Ambient soundscape</span><button class="btn" data-modal="music">'+(S.settings.music?'ON':'OFF')+'</button></div><div class="row"><span>Ambient volume</span><input type="range" min="0" max="0.8" step="0.05" value="'+(S.settings.musicVolume??.22)+'" data-volume="musicVolume"></div><div class="row"><span>Interface tones</span><button class="btn" data-modal="sfx">'+(S.settings.sfx?'ON':'OFF')+'</button></div><div class="row"><span>Effects volume</span><input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="'+(S.settings.sfxVolume??.6)+'" data-volume="sfxVolume"></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn fill" data-modal="close">Done</button></div>')}
function pauseModal(){modal('<span class="kicker">FIELD OFFICE PAUSED</span><h2>Let the frontier breathe.</h2><p>Your expedition is safe. The local save updates after meaningful actions.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-modal="settings">Sound & controls</button><button class="btn" data-modal="export">Export save</button><button class="btn fill" data-modal="close">Return to field</button></div>')}
function credits(){modal('<span class="kicker">VERDIGRIS ELSEWHERE · FIELD EDITION</span><h2>The work is shared.</h2><p>An original Art Nouveau frontier illustration was created for the game. Interface tones are generated locally with Web Audio. Optional bundled ambience is local and no sound is streamed.</p><p><b>Designed as:</b> a detective adventure across an expanding interstellar frontier, where evidence alters inheritance, supply and civic trust.</p><p><b>Random draw:</b> seed 18240392166084411876 · detective adventure / interstellar colonization / Art Nouveau / genetics and inheritance / expanding frontier / philosophical.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn fill" data-modal="close">Return to map</button></div>')}
function resetModal(){modal('<span class="kicker">NEW EXPEDITION</span><h2>Leave this record behind?</h2><p>This clears the locally saved campaign. Export first if you want a backup.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-modal="close">Stay here</button><button class="btn" data-modal="export">Export save</button><button class="btn fill" data-modal="reset">Clear record</button></div>')}
function exportSave(){let b=new Blob([JSON.stringify(S,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(b);a.download='verdigris-expedition.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000);notice('Expedition exported.')}
function begin(diff){S=fresh(diff);$('title').classList.add('hidden');$('game').classList.remove('hidden');view='frontier';region=0;render();ambiance();log('First landing','The field office opens on the Glass Orchard. The world is inherited, but its future is not fixed.');save();modal('<span class="kicker">LANDING DAY · CYCLE 1</span><h2>A world already in motion.</h2><p>The colony archive records plants as citizens and old decisions as weather. You are the field investigator: follow traces, settle disagreements and choose what travels to the next generation.</p><p><b>First:</b> survey the Glass Orchard, then open its case. Find two observations before recording a conclusion. Tags appear only after inspection.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn fill" data-modal="close">Open the field office</button></div>')}
function continueGame(){S=load();if(!S)return;$('title').classList.add('hidden');$('game').classList.remove('hidden');region=S.open[S.open.length-1]||0;view='frontier';render();ambiance()}
$('begin').onclick=()=>{let diff=document.querySelector('.difficulty .selected').dataset.diff;if(load()){modal('<span class="kicker">NEW EXPEDITION</span><h2>Replace the current record?</h2><p>Starting over overwrites the local save.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" data-modal="close">Keep current</button><button class="btn fill" id="confirm-new">Begin new expedition</button></div>');$('confirm-new').onclick=()=>{closeModal();begin(diff)}}else begin(diff)};
$('continue').onclick=continueGame;$('pause').onclick=pauseModal;$('brand').onclick=()=>{view='frontier';render()};$('settings-title').onclick=()=>{S=load()||fresh('standard');settingsModal()};document.querySelectorAll('[data-diff]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-diff]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x===b))});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'&&!$('game').classList.contains('hidden'))pauseModal()});let prior=load();if(prior){$('continue').classList.remove('hidden');$('intro').textContent='Your field record waits at cycle '+prior.cycle+'. The frontier remembers.'}render();